1
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:07,460
“So the Geng family is really like this?”

2
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,179
“Mum, who is this?”

3
00:00:59,964 --> 00:01:03,957
“Don’t worry about it. Hurry back inside and don’t come out!”

4
00:01:23,042 --> 00:01:24,621
“Is the money ready?”

5
00:01:30,098 --> 00:01:33,746
“Brother Bald Head, it’s all ready, it’s all ready …”

6
00:01:52,831 --> 00:01:58,893
“These men come to ask for money every month. They really want to force people to death!”

7
00:01:59,993 --> 00:02:02,951
“No, there’s no law about it at all!”

8
00:02:04,051 --> 00:02:10,114
“Shh, keep your voices down. These men are sent by the Xiao family to collect money regularly.”

9
00:02:28,044 --> 00:02:30,984
“What the f*ck is all this stuff?”

10
00:02:42,421 --> 00:02:45,725
“Can this pile of rags be worth ten thousand?”

11
00:02:50,432 --> 00:02:57,874
“Brother Bald Head, it’s exactly ten thousand. We’ve counted it all. You can count it yourself if you don’t believe me.”

12
00:03:04,505 --> 00:03:05,705
“Bullsh*t!”

13
00:03:17,728 --> 00:03:18,928
“Mum!”

14
00:03:38,935 --> 00:03:44,653
“Chen Ping, who told you to come out? Go inside quickly and stay out of it!”

15
00:03:50,899 --> 00:03:55,581
“Mum, since I’m out here anyway, let me handle this. Just sit tight!”

16
00:04:04,905 --> 00:04:13,725
“Isn’t this the guy who hit Young Master Xiao with a brick and spent three years in jail? I didn’t expect him to be out!”

17
00:04:14,825 --> 00:04:24,680
“It’s really time for you to come out. Today is the big wedding day of your girlfriend and Young Master Xiao. Aren’t you the ex-boyfriend coming to attend?”

18
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:27,360
“Green hat turtle …”

19
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:29,660
“Hahahaha …”

20
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,939
“What did you say?”

21
00:04:44,416 --> 00:04:56,685
“I said that the woman you went to jail for is getting married to Young Master Xiao today. The wedding is being held at the Regal Hotel. It’s luxurious, aren’t you coming to see it?”

22
00:05:25,293 --> 00:05:29,975
“Kneel down and apologise to my mother, and I can spare your lives.”

23
00:05:49,829 --> 00:05:54,449
“What did you say? You want me to kowtow and apologise?”

24
00:06:24,314 --> 00:06:26,928
“Chen Ping, you can’t keep fighting …”

25
00:06:46,012 --> 00:06:49,316
“Beat him to death, beat him to death …”

26
00:07:29,223 --> 00:07:30,803
“Apologise to my mother!”

27
00:07:46,810 --> 00:07:48,070
“I’m sorry …”

28
00:07:55,326 --> 00:07:56,526
“Get lost!”
